# GSAP ScrollTrigger

When adding or editing ScrollTrigger config (`ScrollTrigger.create`, `scrollTrigger: { ... }`):

- Do not remove existing `markers: false` when editing ScrollTrigger code.

Only set `markers: true` (or omit `markers: false`) when the user explicitly requests visible ScrollTrigger markers for debugging.
